{"parse": {"title": "AFF-01", "pageid": 123501, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFF-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-02\" title=\"AFF-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B3.95.E5.85.B0.E8.A5.BF.E7.89.B9.E5.BF.AB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"法兰西特快\">法兰西特快</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 法兰西特快</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The French Express</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>确<span class=\"color-value\"></span>保<span class=\"color-value\"></span>任<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>预<span class=\"color-value\"></span>言<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>保<span class=\"color-value\"></span>质<span class=\"color-value\"></span>期<span class=\"color-value\"></span>内<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>及<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>说<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3210101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>就不能麻利点吗，阿黛拉？堵车，罢工……我受够了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>玛莱区的街道是有些窄，这没办法。至少我们已经到了地方……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那间沙龙应该就在楼上。还好孚日广场附近人不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>当然，亲爱的司机小姐，你宝贵的车只有德佩区的宽阔大道才配得上——我的东西呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金属碰撞声和细碎的摩擦声证明了司机的努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>——在这儿！我找到了，完美无损！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_01\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-3_2_at_01.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-3_2_at_01.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-3_2_at_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我不得不再次提出那个老问题，费利西安小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>咱们一定得带着这种易碎的甜点到处跑吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>你稍作努力，让拉杜丽开遍全巴黎，自然就不必这样麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>您真是高看我了——喔，我们还提前了十分钟，可以慢慢走上楼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这段时间以来，她已经习惯了这位小姐的脾气，也熟练掌握了让对方消气的技巧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>全怪我考虑得不够周到。明天我来接您之前，先去一趟香榭丽舍大街……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>你知道就好。走吧，今天你选的这条近道还不错，总算没有迟到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这句话多少给疲惫的司机提供了几分动力。<br />她关上车门，张开双臂转了个得意的圈儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313527.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-313527.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313527.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313527.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-313527.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313527.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-313527.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313527.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>看吧，我接下您的单子时可没胡说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313527.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-313527.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313527.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313527.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-313527.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313527.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-313527.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313527.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>“整个巴黎的一切，全都在我脑袋里头！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:center\"><i>吾等本为虚无。永远的国度、权柄与荣耀，皆归于祢——</i></span><br /><span style=\"text-align:center\"><i>（ATAH MAKUTH VE-GEBURAH VE-GEDULAH)</i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:center\"><i>永世无尽，阿门。</i></span><br /><span style=\"text-align:center\"><i>(LE-OLAHM AMEN)</i></span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_19\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>香棒在静室中燃烧，乳香、没药与鸢尾根的气味漫散开来，所有人都屏息注视着位于中央的女子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她神情肃穆，口中念念有词。在用一根一半白色、一半黑色的朴素术杖分别向四个方向画出五芒星的图案后，她向两侧伸出双臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>拉斐尔，在我面前现身。加百列，在我身后现身。米迦勒，在我右手侧现身。乌列尔，在我左手侧现身——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>五芒星在此熊熊燃烧，六芒星于光柱中闪耀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着她顿挫的声音落下，熏香燃烧着的火焰忽地明亮了一瞬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>我看见了……我看见了那自北方出现的旋风、巨云，以及向内侧熊熊燃烧的火焰……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>那万丈光辉，正是祂之智慧在地上的显现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>怎么样，雷曼女士？您是否……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>我已自星界请来了四位大天使在此投下他们的化身，他们将借予我力量，令我可以一窥那意象宝库中的秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>您的丈夫不知踪迹，但他的影子仍在家中徘徊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>是的……是的！您说得对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>我总能感觉到……有时还能看见他的身影！就穿着那件土黄的大衣……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人急切地凑上前去，紧紧扒住占卜桌的边沿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>我请求您，女士！请告诉我他究竟遇到了什么？要怎样才能让他回来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人的话让阿黛拉皱起眉头。她压低声音，让自己的话混入台下的议论声中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>她说的是最近的失踪案。有不少人都想找大人物们要一个解释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>但解释可没那么好找，我的警察朋友忙活了半天也没见有结果。你觉得这位占卜师会怎么说？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640917.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-640917.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640917.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640917.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-640917.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640917.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-640917.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640917.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>大概是诅咒或者恶魔附体一类的。总是这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师朝满眼恳切的妇人点了点头，转身面向台下众人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>这位可怜女子的丈夫遭到了诅咒——一头野兽的诅咒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>它未能诞生自温暖的血肉之中，而是由笼罩这座城市的黑暗孵化而生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>旧的秩序崩坏已久，新的乐园却迟迟没能得到兑现。魔鬼从未走远，它们在我们的近旁虎视眈眈，蛊惑每一个摇摆的灵魂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>于是它才自百年的沉睡中苏醒，现身于这个时代，将苦痛施加于众人！<br />是我们唤醒了它——那热沃当的野兽！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那个不祥的名字令屋内瞬间安静下来。<br />人们屏住呼吸，半晌后掺着恐惧的惊呼声才小心翼翼地响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅰ：</div><div>怪不得总有隆隆怪响……是那些黑影回来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅱ：</div><div>难道我铺子里那些不来干活的家伙，也是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>好吧，你猜对了。又是老一套，“诅咒”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>要是这种东西真的存在，我的家族根本就传不到我这一代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-640901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-640901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-640901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>少说我不爱听的。你死了谁来给我开车？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抛下这句话，转过头盯着台上的占卜师，不再理会不懂事的司机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>我无法消灭那只野兽，它实在过于强大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>但我可以限制那诅咒的效力，削弱它的影响。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等在一旁的学徒适时地为她捧上许多小物件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一块刻有奇妙符号的水晶，以及墨水、白蜡烛与黑色丝绸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-641501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-641501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-641501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>天上如此，地下亦然。一切存在都彼此相连，万物在这条永恒的巨链中均有自己的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-641501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-641501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-641501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>有时，我们能够自那些更加完美的存在处借来些许力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-641501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-641501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-641501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>我将借助来自土星的智性，为你制作一块能够限制诅咒的灵摆。佩戴它一段时日，你的丈夫将会归来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>好的，好的！太感谢您了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_20\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-3_2_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-3_2_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-3_2_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>费利西安的耐心只够坚持到听完这段话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她悄无声息地起身，阿黛拉也紧跟着迈出步子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>我还以为能在这里听到些新鲜的神秘学理论，或者有意思的八卦……没想到是无聊套话而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>所以我才说，巴黎好玩的地方多的是，想逛街有老佛爷百货公司，各种小玩意都在圣图安市场，没必要特地赶过来看这种……好吧，演出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群已经涌向前去，争着向占卜师寻求解答。只有少数人像她们一样打算退场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管没人会在意，阿黛拉还是压低了声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>下次就考虑我的建议……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>我已经买下了你的时间，你的工作就是陪同我去城里任何一个我想去的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>好吧。我投降。一切都按您的意见办。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉总结出的应对技巧并不会每次都起效。<br />费利西安停下脚步，似笑非笑地望向她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>观赏闹剧也算是一种消遣。再说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>你对这类“占卜”也并不是全无兴趣。比如，《高等魔法的教义与仪式》？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>呃！那些书都是看着玩……而且你怎么知道的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>“看着玩”。对，在每一个“家族诅咒”词条下面画上红色波浪线，你就喜欢玩这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>你看到过？嘿，你究竟怎么知道的？快告诉我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于占卜沙龙的主办者来说，这番喧闹的景象或许过于显眼了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>这位小姐，请暂留脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>迷途的乌云和执妄的枷锁正笼罩着你……你已灾厄缠身，而我能拨开你的迷雾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>请靠近些，让我能看得更清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到所有目光都汇聚过来，阿黛拉才明白占卜师指的正是她们中的一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>费利西安，她让你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>是的，这位正四处张望的小姐。我希望您能上前来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉看向费利西安，后者像是突然提起了兴趣，轻轻推了她一把。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>就是你了，别傻站着。既然她自己找上门，那就让她见识见识你的本事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……好吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_19\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在众人的注视下，她站到了占卜师对面，将手伸向桌上的灵摆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>说实话，女士，我对您的占卜不感兴趣，您这些小伎俩也唬不到我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>但我可不希望被您当做打响名号的幌子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拿起水晶，对着一旁的烛火照了照。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>通透纯净、手感温和……本来是枚不错的水晶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>——可惜它的颜色太过均匀，一点包裹体和裂隙都没有，显然有人动过手脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>什么？可是……可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>很快您就会知道它的真假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一条小龙在眨眼间从她的袖口探出头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>唯以真知炼化虚妄。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_19\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火光一闪，近旁的妇人并未感受到任何高温，而原本美丽的宝石已经变回了丑陋破碎的残次品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小龙灵巧地攀到阿黛拉肩膀上，得到了赞许的抚摸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>干得好，小家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>围观的人群骚动起来，阿黛拉满意地捕捉到几句惊叹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>您把它——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>不必慌张，夫人。我是阿黛拉·塔沃尼尔——就是那个盛产宝石猎人的塔沃尼尔家。也许您曾听过我先祖的名号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>他们曾为路易十四寻回过法兰西之蓝和无数珍宝，那时他们所用的也是和我一样的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>火焰将揭示所触之物的本质，破除迷障，辨明真实与虚假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>很遗憾，女士，这枚水晶并未通过鉴定——我想它并没有什么来自土星的智性，也没能在“存在的巨链”中占到什么好位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>但好在您也不必掏出腰包来支付它的巨额价码了，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>这……您说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人的目光在占卜师与阿黛拉之间来回扫了几趟，最终，她急匆匆地跑下了台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接下来，轮到了这场骗局的始作俑者。阿黛拉转过身面向沉默的占卜师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>好了，我也得对您说声抱歉，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>倘若您的水晶货真价实，我就能帮您炒热气氛了。而现在——唉。<br />发生这种事，我也很遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她朝着台下的观众耸了耸肩，遗憾的是无人开口回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但一两秒后，掌声突兀地响起。费利西安全然不顾周围疑惑的目光，兴致勃勃地为精彩的戏码拍着手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉朝她比了个“一切顺利”的手势，露出笑容。费利西安立刻把脑袋别开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>很近了，你身上的影子……我马上就能看清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她立刻望向占卜师，恰巧对上那双直勾勾盯住她的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>塔沃尼尔家的小姑娘……最年轻的那位，最崭新、最生动的那个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师向前探身，她们之间的距离被压缩得过近了。阿黛拉的脊背窜起一阵寒意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>命定之人刚刚踏上了旅途，没有回头的余地，两次碰撞，先下而后上，你将践行……践行你的命运！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>你注定逃不过宿命的感召！怀有私心的贤者将玩弄你的命运，死亡的深渊正等待你坠入……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>而那地之上的，终将等同那天之下的……你所有的终将消失，死亡亦将引导你最终的升华……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>直到一切都回归！回归那——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>是——野兽——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雷曼女士：</div><div>呃、呃……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>快叫人来！这里有没有医生？你怎么了？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅰ：</div><div>她看起来不能呼吸了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅱ：</div><div>发生了什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>等等——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>她……在笑？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFF-01"}}